      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "GVM Auctioneers are delighted to offer for sale this serviced C. 0.91 acre site at Derrybeg Lane, Killeigh, Tullamore, Co. Offaly.\nThe property enjoys a superb rural location just off the N80, providing excellent access to Tullamore and the surrounding area.\nWith water, electricity and septic tank connected, the site represents an excellent opportunity for a purchaser seeking a countryside location with convenient access to local amenities and transport links.\n\nKEY FEATURES\n\nC. 0.91 acres\nSuperb location just off the N80\nExcellent access to Tullamore\nAttractive rural setting\nWater connected\nElectricity connected\nSeptic Tank\nFolio No. OY27771F\nSale subject to planning permission\nLocal needs planning criteria apply\n\n\nLOCATION\n\nSituated on Derrybeg Lane, Killeigh, Tullamore, Co. Offaly, the site is ideally positioned for access to Tullamore and the surrounding towns and villages.\nThe location offers a peaceful rural setting while benefiting from excellent road access via the N80.\n\n\nViewing and further details by appointment.\nGVM Auctioneers, Arden Road, Tullamore, Co. Offaly\nTel: 057 9321196\nContact GVM Auctioneers for further information and viewing arrangements.\n"
      },
      {
